This Web MiniDisc image runs a MiniDisc metadata service as a separate program.
Web MiniDisc talks to it over HTTP on 127.0.0.1:8001. The browser uses /md-library/.

Source adapted from:
https://github.com/chrishuangcf/minidisc-library
(backend FastAPI app: discs, audio, MusicBrainz enrich, local match)

UPnP/SSDP device discovery is not started in this embedded copy.
